---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<dialog id="experience-dialog" class="experience-dialog" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="dialog-heading"><h2 id="experience-title">Experience settings</h2><button class="icon-button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close experience settings"><Icon name="close"/></button></div>
  <div class="experience-controls">
    <button class="button secondary" id="sound-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Sound off</button>
    <button class="button secondary" id="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Reduce motion</button>
    <button class="button secondary" id="scene-pause" aria-pressed="false">Pause decorative motion</button>
    <label>Display quality<select id="quality-select"><option value="auto">Automatic</option><option value="high">High</option><option value="balanced">Balanced</option><option value="low">Low</option><option value="fallback">Static image</option></select></label>
    <p>Static artwork stays available. Optional 3D loads only when verified models exist. System reduced-motion and data-saving preferences take priority.</p>
    <p>On New Drop, the supplied background track tries to start at low volume and loops. If your browser blocks autoplay, use Sound on. Commercial sound starts when you open a film and has its own mute control. No analytics adapter is active.</p>
  </div>
</dialog>
